  "details": "Some animated Exclusive and Premium spritesheet emoji do not fire correctly, such as the brick, and Spookality emoji.\n\nRepro steps:\n\n1. Launch VRChat, using an account that has these exclusive/premium animated spritesheet emoji\n\n2. Open the Action Menu or the Quick Menu wing\n\n3. Navigate to a \"Exclusive\" or \"Premium\" emoji, such as the brick.\n\n4. Try to fire the emoji.\n\nResults: Users on Open Beta 1815 are unable to see the emoji being fired, while users on Live can still see them.",
